    "body": "I'd be happy to submit a PR for this once GuillaumeGomez/sysinfo#363 is fixed.\r\n\r\n> When I am developing with docker over time my system gets clogged with old containers, networks and images. It will really be helpful if I can keep track of the used space from the shell (especially when I am working on a remote machine over ssh).\r\n\r\nThis use case would be best served by only showing the module below a certain free space threshold, I expect. What values should we consider? A percentage around 10%? ",
